/Contents (Essas dimensıes com 8 cm\re 2 cm n„o s„o boas por \rque s„o comensur·veis\r\(8=4x2\), ent„o o aluno\rpoderia se utilizar desta \rrelaÁ„o entre estas \rmedidas. Aqui queremos\rmedidas x e y sem nenhuma\rrelaÁ„o especÌfica.\rPara evitar uma relaÁ„o\rfacilmente verific·vel, \rsugiro usar medidas \rcomo 7cm e 2cm \(primos\rentre si\).\r\rPara seguir essa aula, \rrecomendo que vocÍ \rrealmente recorte \r4 quadrados com lado 7cm,\r10 quadrados com lado 2cm\re 8 ret‚ngulos com 7cm \rpor 2cm.)
/CreationDate (D:20150924134046-03'00')
/DA (0 0 0 rg /F1 12 Tf)
/DS (font-family:Courier New;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;)
/F 4
/IT /FreeTextTypewriter
/M (D:20150924140201-03'00')
/NM (8e221590-8c8a-4e12-8340fa17cbf4ffd5)
/P 5 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:10.1.5" xfa:spec="2.0.2" style="text-align:left;line-height:normal;font-family:Courier New;font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;text-valign:top;"><p style="color:#FF0000;"><span>Essas&#32;dimens&#245;es&#32;com&#32;8&#32;cm&#13;</span><span>e&#32;2&#32;cm&#32;n&#227;o&#32;s&#227;o&#32;boas&#32;por&#32;&#13;</span><span>que&#32;s&#227;o&#32;comensur&#225;veis&#13;</span><span>\(8=4x2\),&#32;ent&#227;o&#32;o&#32;aluno&#13;</span><span>poderia&#32;se&#32;utilizar&#32;desta&#32;&#13;</span><span>rela&#231;&#227;o&#32;entre&#32;estas&#32;&#13;</span><span>medidas.&#32;Aqui&#32;queremos&#13;</span><span>medidas&#32;x&#32;e&#32;y&#32;sem&#32;nenhuma&#13;</span><span>rela&#231;&#227;o&#32;espec&#237;fica.&#13;</span><span>Para&#32;evitar&#32;uma&#32;rela&#231;&#227;o&#13;</span><span>facilmente&#32;verific&#225;vel,&#32;&#13;</span><span>sugiro&#32;usar&#32;medidas&#32;&#13;</span><span>como&#32;7cm&#32;e&#32;2cm&#32;\(primos&#13;</span><span>entre&#32;si\).&#13;&#13;</span><span>Para&#32;seguir&#32;essa&#32;aula,&#32;&#13;</span><span>recomendo&#32;que&#32;voc&#234;&#32;&#13;</span><span>realmente&#32;recorte&#32;&#13;</span><span>4&#32;quadrados&#32;com&#32;lado&#32;7cm,&#13;</span><span>10&#32;quadrados&#32;com&#32;lado&#32;2cm&#13;</span><span>e&#32;8&#32;ret&#226;ngulos&#32;com&#32;7cm&#32;&#13;</span><span>por&#32;2cm.</span></p></body>)
/Rect [8.253471 272.96811 195.453492 572.080201]
/Subj (M·quina de Escrever)
/Subtype /FreeText
/T (Anne)
/Type /Annot
>>
