/Contents (Desta construÁ„o os alunos poderiam deduzir\rrelaÁıes entre x e y tais como: 4y=x ou\rx\(2x\)=x2+4y \(observando a ·rea total do\rret‚ngulo\).\rEstas relaÁıes n„o s„o compatÌveis com a \rideia de que x e y representam quaisquer\rdois n˙meros positivos.\r)
/CreationDate (D:20150924141808-03'00')
/DA (0 0 0 rg /F1 12 Tf)
/DS (font-family:Courier New;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;)
/F 4
/IT /FreeTextTypewriter
/M (D:20150924143541-03'00')
/NM (b55ecffb-e85f-4c2d-a94fe7889878838b)
/P 7 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:10.1.5" xfa:spec="2.0.2" style="text-align:left;line-height:normal;font-family:Courier New;font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;text-valign:top;"><p style="color:#800080;"><span>Desta&#32;constru&#231;&#227;o&#32;os&#32;alunos&#32;poderiam&#32;deduzir&#13;</span><span>rela&#231;&#245;es&#32;entre&#32;x&#32;e&#32;y&#32;tais&#32;como:&#32;4y=x&#32;ou&#13;</span><span>x\(2x\)=x</span><span style="font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:0.0pt;"><sup>2</sup></span><span>+4y&#32;\(observando&#32;a&#32;&#225;rea&#32;total&#32;do&#13;</span><span>ret&#226;ngulo\).&#13;</span><span>Estas&#32;rela&#231;&#245;es&#32;n&#227;o&#32;s&#227;o&#32;compat&#237;veis&#32;com&#32;a&#32;&#13;</span><span>ideia&#32;de&#32;que&#32;x&#32;e&#32;y&#32;representam&#32;quaisquer&#13;</span><span>dois&#32;n&#250;meros&#32;positivos.&#13;</span><span style="color:#FF0000;"></span></p></body>)
/Rect [45.450539 63.790047 355.050568 172.87941]
/Subj (M·quina de Escrever)
/Subtype /FreeText
/T (Anne)
/Type /Annot
>>
